  <notes>
    <note>
      <text>SCD2 cannot merge Person/Store/email onto hub_customer (different hubs). bv_customer_scd2 historises sat_customer; bv_customer_360 is the cross-hub 360 view. Same pattern for product subcategory/category. pit_employee is single-satellite (engine limit); bv_employee is the current employee+name view. OrganizationNode is binary hierarchyid — use organization_level.</text>
      <noteType>INFORMATION</noteType>
      <xloc>48</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>960</width>
      <height>64</height>
    </note>
